{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, take it, move and check properties. Complete specific task if found. Scan area periodically.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificObjectTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInGripper    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
